Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.39,0:01:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,（光希）啊…小夏呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.11,0:01:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,（茗子）走了…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.23,0:01:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然拜托了「带我去」但是「不行」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.28,0:02:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,即使喊着「等一下」也不看我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,（哭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.72,0:02:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,找不到安慰的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,（叹气）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,光希还在吃吗？我要迟到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.33,0:02:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,（千弥子）身体不舒服吗？-有点心事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.96,0:02:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,如果那样就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.25,0:02:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,留美千弥子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.38,0:02:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,要迟到了！（留美・千弥子）是～！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.26,0:02:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.09,0:03:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,（关门声）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说秋月吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.06,0:03:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,禁闭解除了 今天应该会来的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.19,0:03:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,见面后该怎么安慰才好呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.90,0:03:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不需要笨拙的安慰（光希）诶？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.19,0:03:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,用平常的光希来接触吧那是最重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.20,0:03:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,游…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.20,0:03:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,看你的能耐 谁都会有精神的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.83,0:03:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.37,0:03:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈……不赶紧吃的话就放着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.64,0:03:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,茗子会来吗…（游）会来的那家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.89,0:03:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.85,0:03:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,茗子…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.45,0:04:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,（撞飞的声音）哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.46,0:04:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…啊啊啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,光希
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.42,0:04:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…那个…茗子…（茗子）早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.26,0:04:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.30,0:04:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好了好了！早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,（银太）茗子！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.37,0:04:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 你看起来很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.58,0:04:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起让大家担心了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.91,0:04:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,已经没问题了（麻理・桂子）呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,看那孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.68,0:05:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那个孩子和名村老师…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.60,0:05:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,（光希他们）ツ～ン！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.39,0:05:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.56,0:05:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不用那么担心大家
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我真的没事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.36,0:05:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.62,0:05:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,诶？那个计算器？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,也会占卜和游啊（桂子）嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.97,0:05:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这样做的话占卜这样做的话游
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,-是真的-我试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.93,0:05:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,（电子音）咦？已经结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.23,0:05:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,喂茗子也试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,茗子？（茗子）诶？啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.25,0:06:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然装作很有精神 但是真的很痛苦…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈…跑得还不够呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.89,0:07:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太好了 你看起来比我还好吧茗子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.31,0:07:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯但是我觉得还不行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.69,0:08:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,遭遇了那样的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.57,0:08:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能那么快就恢复过来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.07,0:08:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.99,0:08:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我想正因为有你 茗子才能那样努力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.91,0:08:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋！从初一开始就一直是好朋友吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,现在能支撑秋月的只有你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.09,0:08:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我也和茗子一起努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.80,0:08:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊！这个星期天请茗子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.47,0:08:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要去个痛快的地方玩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.43,0:08:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯那好！是吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,回去的时候顺便去店里玩一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.28,0:08:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.66,0:08:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:09:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,亚梨实…（亚梨实）来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,游！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,哟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.58,0:09:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.83,0:09:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,亚梨实…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.46,0:09:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不会交给你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,亚梨实突然吻了游
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.31,0:09:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.90,0:09:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵…你好（银太）谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你好…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.37,0:09:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,须王 你居然会来这里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.66,0:09:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…啊那就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.50,0:09:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,银太这个星期天
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.71,0:09:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,邀请茗子和大家一起去卡里昂牧场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,秋月？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.21,0:09:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊走吧我那天不打工
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.64,0:10:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.76,0:10:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那我去做便当吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你吃便当吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.48,0:10:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.19,0:10:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.15,0:10:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,什么呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.61,0:10:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我也可以一起去吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.11,0:10:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.07,0:10:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,在我面前说那些快乐的话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,没有被排除在朋友之外的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.99,0:10:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,但是啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.62,0:10:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,亚梨实这次的秋月…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 很多人都很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,亚梨实也来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.33,0:10:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？哇好开心！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也去做一半的便当吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.13,0:10:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,游什么好呢？我什么都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.97,0:10:42.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用客气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.26,0:10:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,光希的人好了为什么不拒绝呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.35,0:10:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但是茗子的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我讨厌不得不说明…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.19,0:10:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,现在只要茗子好就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.94,0:10:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.99,0:11:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？这个星期天？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.91,0:11:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,便当是我做的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.75,0:11:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,茗子就那样来就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在家发呆也没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.51,0:11:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那么详细的时间明天再商量吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.35,0:11:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.47,0:11:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯再见
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,（放下听筒的声音）
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.97,0:11:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 光希
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.56,0:11:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,茗子OK
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.15,0:11:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,想和千弥子商量便当的菜单
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.40,0:11:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我的妈妈那样不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.49,0:11:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,光希…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.17,0:12:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,（哈欠）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.67,0:12:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,带便当了吗？-嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,马上就要结束了啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.47,0:12:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你想拿这么大的东西吗？呵呵…嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,菜也做了很多呢！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.77,0:12:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵…脸上也有便当哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.11,0:12:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈…呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,太晚了光希他们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起！等一下？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.21,0:12:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你在磨蹭什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.71,0:12:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,光希难道是那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.34,0:12:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,全部都是便当？-嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.09,0:13:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他说无论如何都要带着
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.30,0:13:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说有点晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.18,0:13:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,快走吧！喂…喂 光希
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.98,0:13:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.98,0:13:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,快点快点快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.11,0:13:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哇！好舒服！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.50,0:13:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,茗子也来看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,（茗子）真的！呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.96,0:13:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……（光希）哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.55,0:13:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 还有小河和湖泊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.39,0:13:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 还有乘船的地方 我们一起坐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,便当比那个好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？已经吃了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.11,0:14:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,抱着这么大的行李是动弹不得的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.78,0:14:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧吃掉吧（光希）那也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.87,0:14:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害！看起来很好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.33,0:14:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好的请进！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.96,0:14:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.05,0:14:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.05,0:14:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好吃吗？太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不 那样的东西被拿出来之后很难拿出来…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,光希也快点出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,啊？嗯…嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,看！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.98,0:14:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈……虽然不太擅长…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.15,0:14:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但是看起来很好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.37,0:14:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是那么丑啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.54,0:14:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真的好吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:14:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,对你来说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.58,0:14:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哇！哎呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.05,0:15:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.09,0:15:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,没有那样的事！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.26,0:15:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃！好吃！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.51,0:15:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这种说法更伤感情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我带了水果 好的 这个也请
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.44,0:15:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…我开动了~
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯？哦 没有烧焦！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.15,0:15:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯……没有烧焦…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.53,0:15:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,当然啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,别玩了！（光希）再玩儿就惨了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.37,0:15:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,游这边这边！呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.00,0:15:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,光希…（光希）茗子走吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.21,0:15:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,（茗子）光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.00,0:15:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.34,0:15:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那样的…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.47,0:15:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,银太快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好好整理一下 麻烦了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.86,0:16:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,须王太慢了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.15,0:16:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 银太
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,两个人坐着的话肯定会不利吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.57,0:16:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,…真想！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.32,0:16:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,等着我！现在就去追吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.53,0:16:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,银太！加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.16,0:17:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,（叫声）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.38,0:17:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,哈哈…小马好可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.13,0:17:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,（茗子）真的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.47,0:17:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我想摸一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.18,0:17:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,真危险啊 因为你是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:17:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,（光希）哈哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.90,0:18:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我想起了北海道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.36,0:18:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,修学旅行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.11,0:18:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,（快门声音）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.01,0:18:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,如果和那时的六反田来的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.06,0:18:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,（笑声）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.85,0:19:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得口渴了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.27,0:19:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,去买点果汁什么的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.57,0:19:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,-哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.69,0:19:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,（风声）（3人）啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,给你拿来（茗子）小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.74,0:19:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没事没事没事！哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.41,0:19:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,哇！哈哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.70,0:19:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,光希一直都是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.46,0:19:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然很唐突但是很明亮很有精神很想朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.84,0:19:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,呵呵……看着那个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.80,0:19:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,总觉得连我都变得精神起来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.43,0:20:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,哇…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.98,0:20:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,（马嘶）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.15,0:20:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,（亚梨实）游！银太！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.61,0:20:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,（不在）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.11,0:20:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,逃跑吧光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.37,0:20:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,（茗子）光希！光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.75,0:20:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.96,0:20:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,（茗子）光希！光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.13,0:20:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.01,0:20:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.56,0:20:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,（悲鸣）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.98,0:20:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.69,0:20:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,（不在）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.32,0:21:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,龙胆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.03,0:21:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,光希没事吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.08,0:21:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,（敲击声）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.00,0:21:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,光希！光希！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋！我说了危险！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,游！游！（哭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.10,0:21:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起…对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.23,0:21:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,已经可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,（哭声）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,恋爱怎么也不如意啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.96,0:21:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,游…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.79,0:21:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,游…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.32,0:22:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我原以为父母们的交换结婚是可以接受的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.08,0:22:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,但是当我觉得妈妈的名字不一样的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.08,0:22:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有点紧张…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.83,0:22:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,然而父母们的事暴露学校中大恐慌！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.55,0:22:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,橘子酱男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.80,0:22:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,「入籍骚动」「不要说我没常识！」